{"ID":"20240205153909-zjeipv3","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153909-zjeipv3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153909-zjeipv3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091312-nv5fl5c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205155141-1rgzlul\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091312-nv5fl5c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:389,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:389\u0026#125;","title":"羌活","type":"doc","updated":"20240902145826"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206091312-nv5fl5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091312-nv5fl5c","updated":"20240206091321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产云南、四川、青海、甘肃等地。\n【性状】\t蚕羌：又名：螺丝羌。为干燥的根茎部，形态似蚕。呈圆柱状或略弯曲，长约410cm，直径约12cm。顶端有茎叶残基。表面棕褐色，有多数紧密而隆起的环节。节上密生疣状突起的须根痕。质轻松易折断，断面不齐，有明显的菊花纹和多数裂隙，皮部棕红色；木质部淡黄色，中央有黄白色髓，均有朱砂点 (油管) 。具特殊香气，味微苦而麻。\n竹节羌：根茎的环节较稀，如竹节状，似蚕羌而略大。\n大头羌：根茎的环节特别膨大，呈不规则团块状，大小不等，顶端具多数残留茎基，余皆与蚕羌相同。\n条羌：为干燥的根及支根。呈圆柱形或分枝，长317cm，直径约0.71.7cm，顶端偶可见有根茎，表面棕褐色，有纵纹及疣状突起的须根痕，上端较粗大，有稀疏隆起的环节，质疏松而脆、易折断，断面不平坦，皮部浅棕色，木部黄白色，有菊花纹，朱砂点不明显，中央无髓。气味较淡薄。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，温。\n【功效】\t散表寒；祛风湿；利关节；止痛。主治外感风寒、头痛无汗、风寒湿痹、风水浮肿、疮疡肿毒。\n【注解】\t“朱砂点”：指药材平整切面上可见的散在棕色或黄橙色油点。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091313-0yko7gu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091313-0yko7gu","updated":"20240206091313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091313-pbzh4wq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155141-1rgzlul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155141-1rgzlul","updated":"20240205155141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"羌活"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/羌活-20240205155141-mw7h6eq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723125042-uyf34ab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723125042-uyf34ab","updated":"20240723125042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"短毛独活（东北牛防风、老山芹）"}]},{"ID":"20240723125042-gjkjrw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723125042-gjkjrw1","updated":"20240723125042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独活 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独活 5-20240723110416-op800qt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 625px;","style":"width: 615px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独活 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独活 6-20240723110455-qc24h8z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 615px;\" parent-style=\"width: 625px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723125042-labcyen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723125042-labcyen","updated":"20240723125042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"独活 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/独活 7-20240723110602-v7dja9i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"wid